    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>根据输入的正整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>，画出如图所示的反写字母“<code>Z</code>”形状的字符图案。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n = 2</span>时，图案为：</p>\n<pre><code>*****\n *\n  *\n   *\n*****\n</code></pre>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "根据输入的正整数 n，画出如图所示的反写字母“Z”形状的字符图案。\n例如 n = 2时，图案为：\n*****\n *\n  *\n   *\n*****"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输入一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>。（<span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\le n \\le 10</span>）</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输入一个整数 n。（1 \\le n \\le 10）"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输出 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 行打印的“<code>Z</code>”字图形。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输出 n 行打印的“Z”字图形。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>2</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>*****\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n*****</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>4</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>*********\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n    *\r\n     *\r\n      *\r\n       *\r\n*********</pre>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>5</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>***********\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n    *\r\n     *\r\n      *\r\n       *\r\n        *\r\n         *\r\n***********</pre>\n                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            2\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            *****\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n*****\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                4\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                *********\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n    *\r\n     *\r\n      *\r\n       *\r\n*********\n                            \n                        \n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                5\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                ***********\r\n *\r\n  *\r\n   *\r\n    *\r\n     *\r\n      *\r\n       *\r\n        *\r\n         *\r\n***********"
